_path.replace is not a function due to the fact path holds a reference to a class controller instance, not a string ..._

Find two snapshots illustrating the crash, one for the exception thrown, the other one for the variable values while the exception is thrown.

Our basecode is somewhat complex. Here is a full working example. It is using winston a logger framework and can be get ridden of in AbstractService (asbtract base class of every service) and InitializeRoutes

